---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <!-- Decorative left column -->
    <div class="about-deco" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="big-letter">I</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="about-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        ¿Qué es ISO?
      </p>

      <h2 class="about-title">
        <span class="outline">take a</span><br />
        <span class="outline">break.</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="about-body">
        <p>
          ISO nace de la cancha. De ese momento en que solo quedas tú y el aro.
          Sin compañeros. Sin excusas. Puro juego.
        </p>
        <p>
          Diseñamos ropa para los que entienden eso. Para los que se quedan
          después del entrenamiento. Para los que llevan la cancha a la calle.
        </p>
        <p>
          Drops limitados. Sin reposición. Si lo ves, es el momento.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="values">
        <div class="value">
          <span class="v-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <span class="v-text">Calidad sin compromiso</span>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <span class="v-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <span class="v-text">Ediciones limitadas</span>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <span class="v-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <span class="v-text">Diseño de calle</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 75vh;
    max-width: var(--max-w);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Decorative column */
  .about-deco {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .big-letter {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 40vw;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--border-light);
    line-height: 1;
    user-select: none;
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-45%);
  }

  /* Content */
  .about-content {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) var(--pad);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .line {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 0.78;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .outline {
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px var(--white);
    display: block;
  }

  .filled {
    color: var(--white);
    display: block;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--muted-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  /* Values */
  .values {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .value {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .v-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .v-text {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-light);
  }

  /* ========== RESPONSIVE ========== */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .about-deco {
      display: none;
    }

    .about-content {
      padding: 3rem var(--pad) 4rem;
    }

    .about-body p {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
